# DSA-5 | BrowseComp-Plus, 100 stratified questions (experiments/dsa_sample100.json; accuracy reweighted to the 775
#   questions both earlier runs answered) | DSPy.RLM ablation arm 5 | Qwen3-Embedding-8B dense on :8001 (not preserved, K22)
# Arm 5: everything matchable matched to the snippet REPL agent (BCP-9): gpt-5 high root / gpt-5 medium sub-LM, top-5, 512-token
#   snippets, plus the arm-3 changes.
# Control: BCP-9 (snippet REPL agent, same 100 questions); also compared with the original DSPy dense run (row 5 of the
#   original repository's summary workbook).
# code: original/RLM_2026-11-11/RLM/examples/browsecomp_eval_dspy_rlm.py + rag/ (the 2026-10-31 files, incl. the
#   result-queue fix; not src/, see CHANGES_FROM_ORIGINAL.md "Second snapshot")
# budgets: 100 turns (--max-iters 100), no search cap (--max-search 1000000), no sub-LLM cap (DSPY_MAX_LLM_CALLS=100000),
#   60,000-character output (RLM_MAX_OUTPUT_CHARS), 1 h per question (--timeout 3600), get_document not printed
#   (GETDOC_INLINE_CHARS=0, DSPY_QUIET_GETDOC=1), signature v21 + MINIMAL_TOOL_DOCS=1, --top-k 5; SEARCH_SNIPPET_TOKENS=512
# effort: AZURE_OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT / SUB_LM_REASONING_EFFORT are read by src/dspy_rlm/agent.py build_lm; whether the
#   setting reached the model is not recorded in the records (UNKNOWN).
# run: 2026-10-31/11-01; 5 shards of 20 questions; 100 records. In-run "correct": the .env judge of the original repository
#   (K15, interim). Reported: gpt-4.1 via src/ablation_report.py (report.json in the run directory).
# original output: <original repo>/logs/dspy_ablation/arm5 (s0..s4 .json/.log/.txt, report.json, _judge_cache_gpt41.json)
ROW_ID=DSA-5
BENCHMARK=browsecomp_plus
ENTRY=original/RLM_2026-11-11/RLM/examples/browsecomp_eval_dspy_rlm.py
LAUNCHER="experiments/dsa_arm5.sh"
CONTROL=BCP-9
SAMPLE=agents/dspy_rlm/experiments/dsa_sample100.json
AZURE_OPENAI_MODEL=${AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_GPT5}   # gpt-5 root and sub-LM (original: a personal deployment name)
AZURE_OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT=high
SUB_LM_MODEL=${AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_GPT5}
SUB_LM_REASONING_EFFORT=medium
AZURE_OPENAI_TIMEOUT=900
SUB_LM_TIMEOUT=600
SUB_LM_MAX_TOKENS=32000
AZURE_OPENAI_MAX_TOKENS=32000
EMBEDDING_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:8001
RETRIEVER_TIMEOUT=300
MINIMAL_TOOL_DOCS=1
GETDOC_INLINE_CHARS=0
RLM_MAX_OUTPUT_CHARS=60000
SEARCH_SNIPPET_TOKENS=512
DSPY_MAX_LLM_CALLS=100000
DSPY_QUIET_GETDOC=1
AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2025-04-01-preview
RUN_ARGS='--indices <20 per shard> --sig v21 --top-k 5 --max-iters 100 --max-search 1000000 --timeout 3600 --out <run dir>/s<k>'
ENV_UNSET='SEARCH_SNIPPET_LEN MAX_TOP_K MAX_SEARCH_PER_TURN DISABLE_GET_DOCUMENT AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT'
ORIGINAL_OUTPUT="<original repo>/logs/dspy_ablation/arm5"
